      "title": "A machine-checked proof of Erd\u0151s Problem 306 in Lean 4",
      "description": "A sorry-free Lean 4 / Mathlib formalization of Erd\u0151s Problem 306: every positive rational with squarefree denominator is a finite sum of distinct unit fractions whose denominators are squarefree semiprimes. The headline theorem is stated identically to the google-deepmind/formal-conjectures formulation and is complete modulo two explicitly named, verbatim Rosser\u2013Schoenfeld (1962) inputs.",
